{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hana.purikura",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "开园前的园区，她说要拍大头贴",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hana.purikura",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hana.purikura",
    "idolId": "hana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "开园前。真的一个客人都没有，喷泉的声音显得特别大。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "真的、完全没有客人呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，哈哈……因为还没开园啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "感觉有点奇怪，先随便在园区里走走吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "好──！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──羽那，今天虽然是为了工作来取材，时间也有限，",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过你要是能像单纯来游乐园玩一样，尽情享受就好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这段时间，羽那的希望我什么都帮你实现。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，嗯──！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……那，制作人，那个──！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "大头贴？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "嗯！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "不拍吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，两个人？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……？嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，那个就有点……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "诶──",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "不行的话，今天就只能在这儿散散步了哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "确、确实是这样没错……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……你说过「羽那的希望什么都帮我实现」吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "唔……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……对吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………知道了。去拍吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，太好了──",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "text": "机器的声音：『先从第一张开始哦♡』",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，已经开拍了！？怎、怎么办……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "呵呵，制作人，太慌张了──！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个，姿势是──",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊，是之前你查的那个吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "那，来，半边爱心。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "制作人也做半边？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不不，在这里做那个姿势实在太──",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "text": "『决定姿势♡　３、２、１──』",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "快，快点────",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，总觉得，好微妙的姿势──！",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "都、都是我的错，抱歉……",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "不会，没关系。不过──",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "下次要好好给我比一个漂亮的爱心哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "text": "『决定姿势♡　３、２、１──』",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，贴纸出来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "哇──　──……",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……怎么说呢，两个人的脸都完全不像。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "是啊──，眼睛好大──！",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，总觉得，好可惜。"
      }
    }
  },
